Qwen3 & FOLIO & 0.77 & 1.26 & 83.33 & $+$1.47 \\
Qwen2.5-14B & FOLIO & 0.74 & 1.30 & 75.98 & $-$0.49 \\
Qwen2.5-7B & FOLIO & 0.66 & 1.46 & 75.98 & $+$0.49 \\
\addlinespace
Mistral-7B ($T{=}0.3$) & FOLIO & 0.53 & 1.77 & 58.33 & $-$1.47 \\
